# One site, one address.
#
# The site answers on four hostnames: findaschool.ie and findmyschool.ie,
# each with and without www. Left alone, that is four indexable copies of
# 4,579 pages, and a search engine has to guess which is the real one. It
# usually guesses, splits the ranking between them, and indexes fewer pages
# than it otherwise would.
#
# So: findaschool.ie is the site. Everything else is a permanent redirect to
# it, path preserved, so an old link to any hostname still lands on the page
# the visitor wanted. The 301 (rather than 302) is what passes the accrued
# ranking across, and the ! forces the rule even when a file of that name
# exists on the alias.
#
# findmyschool.ie is kept and pointed here rather than dropped: it is the
# name people are likelier to type from memory, and it costs nothing to own
# the door as long as it opens into the same building.

https://www.findaschool.ie/*    https://findaschool.ie/:splat    301!
http://www.findaschool.ie/*     https://findaschool.ie/:splat    301!
https://findmyschool.ie/*       https://findaschool.ie/:splat    301!
http://findmyschool.ie/*        https://findaschool.ie/:splat    301!
https://www.findmyschool.ie/*   https://findaschool.ie/:splat    301!
http://www.findmyschool.ie/*    https://findaschool.ie/:splat    301!
